<title>SWEDEN: Volvo says U.S. June car sales up 11.6pct.</title>
<headline>Volvo says U.S. June car sales up 11.6pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo said on Tuesday that its U.S. car sales rose 11.6 percent in June against the same month a year ago to 8,965.</p>
</text>
